st Maris's contacts, Kael takes the charts, and Veya is forced to admit she was wrong to distrust the Wardens.","depends_on":["scn_forge_cables"]},{"id":"scn_charts_shared","title":"Truth Shared at Silverspine","summary":"Veya returns to Silverspine and shows her full signal data and bridge charts to the scholars, admitting her errors. The Academy confirms the decoding and spreads it to the isles, so the Cartel can no longer bury it.","location_id":"loc_silverspine","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris"],"goal":"Make the signal public so no single faction can own it.","conflict":"Veya's pride resists admitting mistakes in front of her peers, and Maris questions whether giving up the secret will leave her isle exposed.","outcome":"The isles now know of the Dyson swarm, the Cartel loses its secrecy advantage, and the Bridge Wardens demand the cable back.","depends_on":["scn_sabotage_proof"]}]},{"id":"act_climax","title":"The Answer","purpose":"climax","scenes":[{"id":"scn_relay_standoff","title":"Standoff at the Relay","summary":"At the old relay, the Wardens, the Cartel and the Hollow Circle gather. Kael holds the cable and the lanes, Veya holds the decoded signal, and the bridge begins to fail beneath them.","location_id":"loc_silverspine","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya wants the relay answered openly; Kael wants the last stable routes and the transmission under Cartel control.","conflict":"The bridge is breaking, Kael's monopoly would fail if the answer were shared, and Veya must trust a rival she cannot forgive.","outcome":"Maris leads the crowd to safety through her corridors, and Kael sees that control will cost more than it gains.","depends_on":["scn_charts_shared","scn_sabotage_proof"]},{"id":"scn_choice_to_answer","title":"The Choice to Answer","summary":"Using her wind-sight, Veya charts a safe route while Kael's ledger-mastery brokers a shared agreement among the factions. The Cartel hands over the cable, the Wardens fit it, and the isles send their reply together.","location_id":"loc_silverspine","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael","chr_maris"],"goal":"Join the factions in sending one answer to the swarm and stabilise the bridge.","conflict":"Wind-debt, toll grievances and distrust threaten to break the agreement, and Veya and Kael each have to give up what they most wanted.","outcome":"The answer is transmitted and the bridge holds, and a reply pulse begins to travel back from the swarm.","depends_on":["scn_relay_standoff"]}]},{"id":"act_resolution","title":"After the Reply","purpose":"resolution","scenes":[{"id":"scn_new_charter","title":"Tolls Rewritten","summary":"At Mistral Docks, Kael presents a revised toll arrangement with the Wardens that eases the wind-debt on essential crossings and lifts the grain levy on The Hollow. The merchants are stunned that he chose it.","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_kael","chr_veya"],"goal":"Kael wants to rebuild the Cartel's standing on terms the isles will accept.","conflict":"Cartel princes object to the loss of revenue, and Kael has to weigh price against worth for the first time.","outcome":"The agreement passes narrowly, ending the worst of the Toll War and easing the grain levy.","depends_on":["scn_choice_to_answer"]},{"id":"scn_hollow_harvest","title":"A Quiet Harvest","summary":"Back in The Hollow, Maris watches grain move openly along the mended bridges. She forgives Kael only partly, and accepts that her quiet work helped save the isles as much as any open stand.","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_maris","chr_veya"],"goal":"Maris wants to see The Hollow fed without smuggling, and to settle her friendship with Veya.","conflict":"Her slow trust and reluctance to forgive make her doubt that the peace will last.","outcome":"Maris puts away her smuggling routes and keeps her friendship with Veya, which now rests on shared trust.","depends_on":["scn_new_charter"]},{"id":"scn_new_charts","title":"Charts for Everyone","summary":"Veya publishes the full chart of the bridges and the swarm's reply at Silverspine, crediting the Wardens, Maris and her mentor. She sends a copy to Kael, who accepts it as an equal.","location_id":"loc_silverspine","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya wants to share the charts and the reply openly, and to finish her mentor's work.","conflict":"She still struggles to admit her mistakes in public, and the reply from the swarm raises questions the isles cannot yet answer.","outcome":"The isles face the swarm's reply together, with open charts, easier tolls and a new willingness to share what they know.","depends_on":["scn_hollow_harvest"]}]}]}
