ds_on":["scn_docks_collapsed_deal"]},{"id":"scn_rivals_meet_ledger","title":"Old Apprentices","summary":"Kael corners Veya in a dockside tavern. Old friendship and old rivalry surface as he tries to charm her into trading her charts for access to the ledger records she needs.","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael"],"goal":"Kael wants Veya's charts to find the safest routes for the Cartel; Veya wants the shipping records he guards.","conflict":"Kael admires her skill yet cannot let her succeed, and Veya refuses to let him control her work.","outcome":"They part without a deal, but Kael lets slip that his ledger holds the original contract terms, and Veya resolves to get a look at it.","depends_on":["scn_veya_charts_arrive"]}]},{"id":"act_rising","title":"Threads and Tolls","purpose":"rising_action","scenes":[{"id":"scn_maris_secret_route","title":"Grain in the Dark","summary":"Veya travels to The Hollow, where Maris is smuggling grain around the Cartel levy. Maris reveals that grain shipments were among the first deals altered by the masked merchant.","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya wants proof that the poisoned deals hit others, and Maris wants to keep The Hollow fed.","conflict":"Maris trusts slowly and suspects Veya is working for the Cartel; Veya's pride makes her bristle at being doubted.","outcome":"Maris agrees to trade secret service corridors for Veya's wind-current knowledge and shares an altered grain manifest bearing the masked merchant's sigil.","depends_on":["scn_rivals_meet_ledger"]},{"id":"scn_enforcers_close_in","title":"Enforcers on the Mill Road","summary":"Cartel enforcers, tracking Maris's smuggling routes, ambush Veya and Maris among the windmills. Maris leads them through unmapped service corridors while Veya reads the winds to time their escape.","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya and Maris want to escape with the altered manifest and keep the smuggling routes secret.","conflict":"The enforcers know the main paths, and Maris must reveal a corridor she swore never to show an outsider.","outcome":"They escape, but Maris's trust is strained and the enforcers report that Veya is aiding smugglers, which reaches Kael.","depends_on":["scn_maris_secret_route"]},{"id":"scn_kael_visits_emberroost","title":"Accusations at the Forge","summary":"Kael travels to Emberroost to confront Bridge Wardens who accuse him of sabotaging forge-island supplies. He suspects the masked merchant is framing him and hunts for evidence in the supply records.","location_id":"loc_emberroost","character_ids":["chr_kael"],"goal":"Kael wants to clear his name and seize control of the last stable skybridge routes through the forge-island's cable supply.","conflict":"The Wardens distrust him, and his belief that price equals worth blinds him to the fact that he is being manipulated into escalating the Toll War.","outcome":"Kael finds forged supply orders carrying the same sigil as the altered deals and realises the masked merchant is a Cartel insider, but he still keeps his ledger secret.","depends_on":["scn_enforcers_close_in"]},{"id":"scn_silverspine_archive","title":"The Cartographers' Archive","summary":"Veya returns to Silverspine Academy and cross-references the altered manifests with her charts. The forged deals all route cargo toward the weakest skybridges, hastening their collapse.","location_id":"loc_silverspine","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya wants to prove that the poisoned deals are deliberately stressing the bridges.","conflict":"Veya cannot admit her earlier theory about the culprit was wrong, and she dismisses Maris's warning that the Cartel is watching the academy.","outcome":"They discover the next forged deal will send heavy cargo over a failing bridge at Mistral Docks, and conclude only Kael's ledger can prove who is behind it.","depends_on":["scn_kael_visits_emberroost"]},{"id":"scn_ledger_heist","title":"The Ledger Gambit","summary":"Veya and Maris sneak into Kael's quarters at Mistral Docks to copy the ledger. Kael catches Veya in the act, and their rivalry erupts as the masked merchant's agents move in on all of them.","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya wants the ledger's original contract terms; Kael wants to protect the ledger and capture the intruder.","conflict":"Kael's ambition and Veya's pride prevent a quick truce, and Maris is nearly caught by Cartel guards while masked agents try to seize the ledger.","outcome":"The three flee together with the ledger as the masked merchant's agents pursue them, forcing Kael and Veya into an uneasy alliance.","depends_on":["scn_silverspine_archive","scn_kael_visits_emberroost"]}]},{"id":"act_climax","title":"The Unmasking","purpose":"climax","scenes":[{"id":"scn_masked_merchant_confrontation","title":"The Mask Falls","summary":"At the Mistral Docks cliff, the masked merchant signs a final deal that would send a heavy cargo convoy over a failing skybridge. Veya, Kael, and Maris confront them before the Drift Cartel's assembled merchants.","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya and Kael want to expose the masked merchant using the ledger; the merchant wants to silence them and finalise the deal.","conflict":"Kael must choose between preserving the ledger's secrets, which would protect him, and publishing it, which would reveal Cartel corruption, while Veya must trust him rather than seize control.","outcome":"Kael opens the ledger publicly and Veya's wind-sight confirms the convoy route is unsafe, exposing the masked merchant as a Cartel insider and halting the deal.","depends_on":["scn_ledger_heist"]},{"id":"scn_bridge_stand","title":"The Failing Bridge","summary":"The masked merchant's loyalists launch the convoy anyway, and the skybridge begins to fail. Ve