":["scn_cartel_reckoning"]},{"id":"scn_new_charts_silverspine","title":"Charts for Everyone","summary":"At Silverspine Academy, Veya publishes her safe-route charts alongside Kael's honest ledger, giving the Bridge Wardens and merchants the means to maintain the failing network together.","location_id":"loc_silverspine","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael"],"goal":"Veya wants to chart a safe route for the archipelago and Kael wants to make amends.","conflict":"Wardens distrust Kael's presence and Veya must vouch for him despite their old rivalry.","outcome":"The Wardens accept shared charts and ledgers as the foundation for repairing the network, and Veya and Kael part as wary allies.","depends_on":["scn_hollow_peace"]}]}]}
