{"world_id":"wld_aetheria","title":"The Mask of Mistral","logline":"When a masked merchant begins poisoning wind-current trade deals at Mistral Docks, cartographer Veya and toll-master Kael are drawn into a noir hunt where Kael's ledger is the only proof that can expose the culprit, and the fragile skybridge economy hangs in the balance.","theme":"Truth shared is safer than power hoarded","acts":[{"id":"act_setup","title":"Poisoned Winds","purpose":"setup","scenes":[{"id":"scn_docks_collapsed_deal","title":"A Deal Gone Sour","summary":"At Mistral Docks, a major wind-current shipping contract collapses mid-signing when its terms are found to have been secretly altered. Kael, the toll-master, rages quietly while a masked merchant slips away into the crowd.","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_kael"],"goal":"Kael wants to salvage the contract and protect the Cartel's grip on the trade lanes.","conflict":"The altered terms bear the forged marks of the Cartel itself, and the masked merchant vanishes before Kael can confront them.","outcome":"Kael realises only his own ledger records the original terms, making it both his proof and his liability, and he begins hiding it from rivals."},{"id":"scn_veya_charts_arrive","title":"Charts at the Docks","summary":"Veya arrives at Mistral Docks seeking a safe route through the failing skybridges and finds merchants panicking over the poisoned deals. She notices that the trade disruptions follow the same wind patterns she has been mapping.","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_veya"],"goal":"Veya wants to gather bridge-crossing records to chart a safe route through the breaking network.","conflict":"The Cartel's clerks refuse her access to shipping records, and her stubbornness makes her push too hard, drawing attention.","outcome":"Veya spots the masked merchant's distinctive sail-sigil in a harbour record and decides to follow the trail, which puts her on a collision course with Kael.","depends_on":["scn_docks_collapsed_deal"]},{"id":"scn_rivals_meet_ledger","title":"Old Apprentices","summary":"Kael corners Veya in a dockside tavern. Old friendship and old rivalry surface as he tries to charm her into trading her charts for access to the ledger records she needs.","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael"],"goal":"Kael wants Veya's charts to find the safest routes for the Cartel; Veya wants the shipping records he guards.","conflict":"Kael admires her skill yet cannot let her succeed, and Veya refuses to let him control her work.","outcome":"They part without a deal, but Kael lets slip that his ledger holds the original contract terms, and Veya resolves to get a look at it.","depends_on":["scn_veya_charts_arrive"]}]},{"id":"act_rising","title":"Threads and Tolls","purpose":"rising_action","scenes":[{"id":"scn_maris_secret_route","title":"Grain in the Dark","summary":"Veya travels to The Hollow, where Maris is smuggling grain around the Cartel levy. Maris reveals that grain shipments were among the first deals altered by the masked merchant.","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya wants proof that the poisoned deals hit others, and Maris wants to keep The Hollow fed.","conflict":"Maris trusts slowly and suspects Veya is working for the Cartel; Veya's pride makes her bristle at being doubted.","outcome":"Maris agrees to trade secret service corridors for Veya's wind-current knowledge and shares an altered grain manifest bearing the masked merchant's sigil.","depends_on":["scn_rivals_meet_ledger"]},{"id":"scn_enforcers_close_in","title":"Enforcers on the Mill Road","summary":"Cartel enforcers, tracking Maris's smuggling routes, ambush Veya and Maris among the windmills. Maris leads them through unmapped service corridors while Veya reads the winds to time their escape.","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya and Maris want to escape with the altered manifest and keep the smuggling routes secret.","conflict":"The enforcers know the main paths, and Maris must reveal a corridor she swore never to show an outsider.","outcome":"They escape, but Maris's trust is strained and the enforcers report that Veya is aiding smugglers, which reaches Kael.","depends_on":["scn_maris_secret_route"]},{"id":"scn_kael_visits_emberroost","title":"Accusations at the Forge","summary":"Kael travels to Emberroost to confront Bridge Wardens who accuse him of sabotaging forge-island supplies. He suspects the masked merchant is framing him and hunts for evidence in the supply records.","location_id":"loc_emberroost","character_ids":["chr_kael"],"goal":"Kael wants to clear his name and seize control of the last stable skybridge routes through the forge-island's cable supply.","conflict":"The Wardens distrust him, and his belief that price equals worth blinds him to the fact that he is being manipulated into escalating the Toll War.","outcome":"Kael finds forged supply orders carrying the same sigil as the altered deals and realises the masked merchant is a Cartel insider, but he still keeps his ledger secret.","depends_on":["scn_enforcers_close_in"]},{"id":"scn_silverspine_archive","title":"The Cartographers' Archive","summary":"Veya returns to Silverspine Academy and cross-references the altered manifests with her charts. The forged deals all route cargo toward the weakest skybridges, hastening their collapse.","location_id":"loc_silverspine","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya wants to prove that the poisoned deals are deliberately stressing the bridges.","conflict":"Veya cannot admit her earlier theory about the culprit was wrong, and she dismisses Maris's warning that the Cartel is watching the academy.","outcome":"They discover the next forged deal will send heavy cargo over a failing bridge at Mistral Docks, and conclude only Kael's ledger can prove who is behind it.","depends_on":["scn_kael_visits_emberroost"]},{"id":"scn_ledger_heist","title":"The Ledger Gambit","summary":"Veya and Maris sneak into Kael's quarters at Mistral Docks to copy the ledger. Kael catches Veya in the act, and their rivalry erupts as the masked merchant's agents move in on all of them.","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya wants the ledger's original contract terms; Kael wants to protect the ledger and capture the intruder.","conflict":"Kael's ambition and Veya's pride prevent a quick truce, and Maris is nearly caught by Cartel guards while masked agents try to seize the ledger.","outcome":"The three flee together with the ledger as the masked merchant's agents pursue them, forcing Kael and Veya into an uneasy alliance.","depends_on":["scn_silverspine_archive","scn_kael_visits_emberroost"]}]},{"id":"act_climax","title":"The Unmasking","purpose":"climax","scenes":[{"id":"scn_masked_merchant_confrontation","title":"The Mask Falls","summary":"At the Mistral Docks cliff, the masked merchant signs a final deal that would send a heavy cargo convoy over a failing skybridge. Veya, Kael, and Maris confront them before the Drift Cartel's assembled merchants.","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya and Kael want to expose the masked merchant using the ledger; the merchant wants to silence them and finalise the deal.","conflict":"Kael must choose between preserving the ledger's secrets, which would protect him, and publishing it, which would reveal Cartel corruption, while Veya must trust him rather than seize control.","outcome":"Kael opens the ledger publicly and Veya's wind-sight confirms the convoy route is unsafe, exposing the masked merchant as a Cartel insider and halting the deal.","depends_on":["scn_ledger_heist"]},{"id":"scn_bridge_stand","title":"The Failing Bridge","summary":"The masked merchant's loyalists launch the convoy anyway, and the skybridge begins to fail. Veya reads the winds to redirect the crossing while Maris guides cargo handlers through service corridors.","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael","chr_maris"],"goal":"They want to stop the convoy and prevent the bridge from collapsing.","conflict":"The wind shifts faster than Veya expected, and Kael's habit of valuing cargo over people nearly costs lives until he reverses course.","outcome":"Kael orders the cargo abandoned to save the crews, the bridge holds, and the Cartel's hold on the docks is shaken.","depends_on":["scn_masked_merchant_confrontation"]}]},{"id":"act_resolution","title":"Costs and Charts","purpose":"resolution","scenes":[{"id":"scn_cartel_reckoning","title":"The Cartel Reckons","summary":"Before the Drift Cartel, Kael accepts the consequences of exposing the corruption, losing his post and much of his power. Veya shares her charts openly rather than hoarding them.","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael"],"goal":"Kael wants to answer for the sabotage and Veya wants her charts used to protect the bridges.","conflict":"Cartel leaders demand the charts be sealed, and Veya must choose between recognition for herself and sharing them freely.","outcome":"Veya releases the charts to all factions, and Kael learns that control cost him more than it gained.","depends_on":["scn_bridge_stand"]},{"id":"scn_hollow_peace","title":"A Quieter Harvest","summary":"Maris returns to The Hollow as the grain levy is relaxed in the wake of the scandal. Veya visits to repay her friendship and the corridors she revealed.","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris"],"goal":"Maris wants to secure The Hollow's grain supply and mend her trust in Veya.","conflict":"Maris still struggles to forgive the risks Veya brought, and Veya must admit when she was wrong.","outcome":"Veya admits her mistakes, Maris reaffirms their friendship, and the Hollow's grain flows openly again.","depends_on":["scn_cartel_reckoning"]},{"id":"scn_new_charts_silverspine","title":"Charts for Everyone","summary":"At Silverspine Academy, Veya publishes her safe-route charts alongside Kael's honest ledger, giving the Bridge Wardens and merchants the means to maintain the failing network together.","location_id":"loc_silverspine","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael"],"goal":"Veya wants to chart a safe route for the archipelago and Kael wants to make amends.","conflict":"Wardens distrust Kael's presence and Veya must vouch for him despite their old rivalry.","outcome":"The Wardens accept shared charts and ledgers as the foundation for repairing the network, and Veya and Kael part as wary allies.","depends_on":["scn_hollow_peace"]}]}]}
