rroost"]},{"id":"scn_ledger_heist","title":"The Ledger Gambit","summary":"Veya and Maris sneak into Kael's quarters at Mistral Docks to copy the ledger. Kael catches Veya in the act, and their rivalry erupts as the masked merchant's agents move in on all of them.","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya wants the ledger's original contract terms; Kael wants to protect the ledger and capture the intruder.","conflict":"Kael's ambition and Veya's pride prevent a quick truce, and Maris is nearly caught by Cartel guards while masked agents try to seize the ledger.","outcome":"The three flee together with the ledger as the masked merchant's agents pursue them, forcing Kael and Veya into an uneasy alliance.","depends_on":["scn_silverspine_archive","scn_kael_visits_emberroost"]}]},{"id":"act_climax","title":"The Unmasking","purpose":"climax","scenes":[{"id":"scn_masked_merchant_confrontation","title":"The Mask Falls","summary":"At the Mistral Docks cliff, the masked merchant signs a final deal that would send a heavy cargo convoy over a failing skybridge. Veya, Kael, and Maris confront them before the Drift Cartel's assembled merchants.","location_id":"loc_mistral_docks","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya and Kael want to expose the masked merchant using the ledger; the merchant wants to silence them and finalise the deal.","conflict":"Kael must choose between preserving the ledger's secrets, which would protect him, and publishing it, which would reveal Cartel corruption, while Veya must trust him rather than seize control.","outcome":"Kael opens the ledger publicly and Veya's wind-sight confirms the convoy route is unsafe, exposing the masked merchant as a Cartel insider and halting the deal.","depends_on":["scn_ledger_heist"]},{"id":"scn_bridge_stand","title":"The Failing Bridge","summary":"The masked merchant's loyalists launch the convoy anyway, and the skybridge begins to fail. Ve