at cannot be sold; Veya's pride makes her gloat before she offers him a place in the new arrangement.","outcome":"Kael yields the Charter's exclusive tolls and agrees to a council with isle representation.","depends_on":["scn_docks_assembly"]}]},{"id":"act_resolution","title":"A New Charter","purpose":"resolution","scenes":[{"id":"scn_hollow_harvest","title":"Grain Without Levy","summary":"In The Hollow, the levy is lifted and Maris, no longer forced to hide, opens the silos to the council's inspectors. She chooses to keep one corridor secret as insurance.","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_maris","chr_veya"],"goal":"Maris wants The Hollow fed and secure; Veya wants to thank her and map the corridors with consent.","conflict":"Maris still trusts slowly and hesitates to share the final corridor even with Veya.","outcome":"Maris shares most routes and understands that hiding can be as brave as standing still, while Veya accepts the limits of what she may ask.","depends_on":["scn_kaels_choice"]},{"id":"scn_emberroost_cables","title":"Cables Restored","summary":"At Emberroost, Wardens and Cartel toll-masters, including Kael, jointly braid new cloudstone cables, with Kael opening his ledgers to resolve the sabotage accusation.","location_id":"loc_emberroost","character_ids":["chr_kael","chr_veya"],"goal":"Restore the bridges using shared supplies and settle the sabotage accusation.","conflict":"Wardens distrust Kael, and Kael must expose the Cartel's own ledger entries to prove his honesty.","outcome":"The ledgers show supplies were diverted by Cartel policy, Kael accepts responsibility, and the first repaired bridge is crossed under the new council's authority.","depends_on":["scn_kaels_choice"]},{"id":"scn_silverspine_new_charter","title":"The New Charter","summary":"At Silverspine, the council signs a revised charter with isle representation, and Veya publishes the full chart in the Academy, crediting her late mentor, Maris and Kael.","location_id":"loc_silverspine","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael","chr_maris"],"goal":"Formalise shared trade law and publish the chart openly.","conflict":"Veya must credit others and forgo sole recognition, while Kael and Maris still carry wariness toward each other.","outcome":"The charter is signed, Veya learns that truths are safer shared, and the isles face the drift together under a common law.","depends_on":["scn_hollow_harvest","scn_emberroost_cables"]}]}]}
