ives at Silverspine and offers Veya Cartel funding in exchange for exclusive rights to her charts. Their shared apprenticeship surfaces old admiration and old grievances. Veya refuses, stung by how close his offer comes to her own hunger for recognition.","location_id":"loc_silverspine","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_kael"],"goal":"Kael wants to buy the charts, and Veya wants to keep control of them.","conflict":"Veya fears becoming like the Cartel leaders, and Kael admires her skill even as he cannot let her succeed.","outcome":"Veya refuses and Kael leaves with a veiled threat, so the Cartel now treats the charts as a target.","depends_on":["scn_docks_toll"]}]},{"id":"act_rising","title":"Breaking Bridges","purpose":"rising_action","scenes":[{"id":"scn_emberroost_cables","title":"The Braided Cables","summary":"Veya travels to Emberroost to verify the cable failures she charted. The forge-island is short of cloudstone, and the Wardens suspect Cartel sabotage. Veya's data matches the failing bridges, but she hides how bad the pattern is because she cannot admit that her first route estimate was wrong.","location_id":"loc_emberroost","character_ids":["chr_veya"],"goal":"Verify that her chart predictions match the failing cables.","conflict":"Her flaw makes her conceal an error in her estimate, and a Warden notices her hesitation.","outcome":"Veya learns one of her predicted safe routes is unreliable, and she keeps this secret.","depends_on":["scn_kael_offer"]},{"id":"scn_hollow_meeting","title":"Secret Paths","summary":"Veya reaches The Hollow, where Maris, who is smuggling grain around the Cartel's levy, agrees to trade her unmapped service corridors for Veya's wind-current knowledge. Maris is wary and slow to trust, but she shows Veya a corridor that avoids the broken bridges.","location_id":"loc_the_hollow","character_ids":["chr_veya","chr_maris"],"goal":"Veya wants an alternative route, and Maris wants to keep The Hollow fed despite the grain levy.","conflict":